# Textual's Command+Return (Super here) sends typed text as an action.
# Commands stay commands, and a flood question keeps the choice.
! welcome
< :textual!u@h JOIN #c
> MODE #c
! type-action #c waves
> PRIVMSG #c :ACTION waves
? line #c * textual waves
! type-action #c /topic hello
> TOPIC #c hello
! type-action #c 1\n2\n3\n4\n5
? ui confirm-flood #c 1\n2\n3\n4\n5
! confirm
> PRIVMSG #c :ACTION 1
> PRIVMSG #c :ACTION 2
> PRIVMSG #c :ACTION 3
> PRIVMSG #c :ACTION 4
> PRIVMSG #c :ACTION 5
? registered textual
